  "details": "EDIT: Please close this out as a non-issue.\n\nWhen holding down at least a combination of three arrow keys on the keyboard, any inputs from the keyboard will lock up until the arrow keys are released from being pushed down.\n\nA user will not be able to access the Quick Menu with ESC, the Action Menu with R, Chatbox with T, or move with WASD or space; any inputs will not register until letting go of the arrow keys.\n\nOS: Windows 10\n\nUsing a wired IBUYPOWER keyboard.\n\nUsing Steam on desktop.",
